<title>HONG KONG: Liu Chong Hing Bank yr net up 21.16 pct.</title>
<headline>Liu Chong Hing Bank yr net up 21.16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   139.0  vs  115.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    45.0   vs  35.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    557.52 vs  460.14</p>
<p>    Company name		 Liu Chong Hing Bank Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 14-21</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 29</p>
<p>NOTE - Liu Chong Hing Bank, 53.68 percent owned by Liu Chong Hing Investment Ltd, provides banking, financial and related services to commercial, industrial and individual customers.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 63 H.K. cents (including an interim dividend of 18 cents) vs 50 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
